    <briefdescription>
<para>Hash-based compression strategy. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Converts candidates into fixed-size fingerprints using LSH or cryptographic hashing, enabling efficient similarity matching and deduplication. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
